# Landing Page Design System

Source: Figma `PORTFOLIO` (`2O3YDs4FfV1ZEwTuinmTpX`), node `143:267`.

## Typography

- **Headings**: Bricolage Grotesque (`--font-bricolage`)
  - Hero/display: ~72px, bold, -0.03em tracking
  - Section titles: ~48px (`lp-section-title`)
  - Card titles: ~36px (`lp-card-title`)
- **Body & nav**: Inter (`--font-inter`)
  - Body: 18px, line-height 1.7 (`lp-body`)
  - Small body: 16px (`lp-body-sm`)
  - Category labels: 14px, bold, uppercase, 0.1em tracking (`lp-category`)

## Colors

| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| `--lp-ink` | `#191d21` | Primary text, buttons |
| `--lp-body` | `#3f444a` | Body copy, nav links |
| `--lp-muted` | `#6b7280` | Meta labels |
| `--lp-surface` | `#f9f9f9` | Section backgrounds |
| `--lp-quote` | `#fcfaf9` | Quote/contact blocks |
| `--lp-border` | `#ebebeb` | Dividers, card borders |
| `--lp-accent-hmi` | `#7b7027` | Automotive HMI cards |
| `--lp-accent-health` | `#366b74` | Healthcare / travel cards |
| `--lp-accent-enterprise` | `#a54711` | Enterprise cards |

## Components

- **Nav**: Floating pill (`lp-nav-pill`) — white ~70% opacity, blur, shadow, rounded bottom 24px
- **Hero**: Gradient shell (`lp-hero-shell`) — warm gradient, 48px radius; keep text-left / photo-right layout
- **Case study cards**: Borderless; `rounded-3xl` image; colored uppercase category; title + description; optional metrics/tags below
- **About**: `#f9f9f9` section bg; rotated profile image (-3deg); awards in `lp-quote-block`
- **Contact**: `#fcfaf9` bg; white rounded-2xl link cards
- **Footer**: Minimal — name, role, social links, copyright

## Motion (preserve)

- `FadeIn` on hero elements
- `Reveal` on section blocks
- `ScrollProgress` at page top
- Card image `group-hover:scale-[1.03]` on case study cards

## Content rules

- Keep all existing copy from `src/data/site.ts` and case study data
- Do not change hero layout structure — only apply Figma styling
- Case study pages use separate `.cs-*` styles (DM Sans); landing uses `.lp-*` and `.landing-page` scope
